note SPDX-License-Identifier: Apache-2.0
note gpu/nvidia/checks/lib-om2.om: what lib.om offers a check composed in an OM-2 program (one whose first unit
note starts with om2): words that take a text, which OM-1 cannot pass (no unsized view). Composed after lib.om.
note field i is the text t
fn ckis i ulong t view uchar * to bool
if ge i get ck_n 2
ret false
end
if ne cklen i len t
ret false
end
for j ulong len t bound 4096
if ne ckch i j ulong get t j
ret false
end
end
ret true
end
